  "releaseNotes": "- PDChat: added Success message type with distinct preview styling\n      - PDChat: fixed dark-mode success preview pop-out background (green tint)\n      - PDChat: fixed textarea not clearing after send via button click or Enter key\n      - PDMessages: input state now owned locally; CanSend evaluated per-keystroke\n      - PDMessages: Enter key handled via native JS preventDefault to block browser newline insertion\n      - PDMessages: textarea forced to recreate via @key rotation on ClearInput\n      - PDMessages: implemented IAsyncDisposable with JSDisconnectedException/TaskCanceledException guards",
